## Conventions

- Models and enums only in `apps/prisma` (usually `schema.prisma` or `prisma/schema.prisma`).
- Schema changes via migrations — not by hand-editing prod DB.
- Naming style (PascalCase models, camelCase fields) — TODO: lock in.
- Backend uses the client from this package; frontend may use types only — never direct DB access.

